>
>and can't get running the onboard sound card. Under Woody the card runs fine,
>
>because in the installation-setup i could manually add the soundcard with
>
>parameters (ad1848, ISA, no PNP with io=530 irq=9 dma=0 dma2=2).
>
>Runs fine under woody, but what must i do under sarge?
>
>Maybe the OSS-Driver won't run under sarge, so i must install the ALSA 
>packages
>
>(Which of these, to get the ad1848 driver?) eventually?
>
>Please help.
>
>
>
>Thanks in advance
>
>Draftman

